WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.600
So I know it's warm in here

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.635
and we just had a huge turkey lunch

00:00:06.635 --> 00:00:07.587
but that doesn't mean we can loose focus

00:00:07.587 --> 00:00:12.207
on how important our annual recap and planing meeting is

00:00:12.207 --> 00:00:15.367
it is the only meeting we celebrate with a turkey lunch

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:18.340
Exactly. So let's all pay attention

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.020
Now forty seven...

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:21.680
I could do it.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:22.920
Just get up and leave

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.560
I could be in costa rica by morning.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.380
On the beach with a mamsita on each arm...

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.380
Dang, those mamasitas.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.700
Get me every time.

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.640
But who am I kidding, I can't leave

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.240
These people need me

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.980
I love meetings.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.340
The structure

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.160
The notes, the smell.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.960
Everyone's here, no one's on Facebook.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.900
And plenty of opportunities to raise my hand. Then...

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.060
It's Anna time.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:55.260
I wonder what the woman I'm gonna marry is doing right now

00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:57.121
She's probably at work

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.103
Or maybe she's showering

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:01.900
No Eliot! You haven't earned that yet!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.720
She is a lady and you will respect her.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.680
I'm sorry I yelled at you.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:11.100
Is this mole new?

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:13.680
Could it be melanoma?

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.660
Am I too young to worry about my legacy?

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.480
Or am I too old?

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.440
What do I define the meaning of my life by?

00:01:22.451 --> 00:01:23.411
... Except Kaylen

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.680
Oh shit, what was she saying?

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.080
Do I nod and say yes?

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.320
But what if she said something racist?

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.820
I can't fall for that again

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:34.760
Alright stay calm. But the whole crowd grows so loud...

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.427
He opens his mouth but the words won't come out

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.260
He's chocking. How?

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:40.776
Everybody's joking now.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:43.620
The clock's run out, time's up, over now!

00:01:43.816 --> 00:01:45.336
I really think we should focus on our legacy.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:50.440
I mean, uh, nowadays everyone wanna talk like they got something to say, but nothing comes out when...

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:56.120
You did it Natalie. You had no idea what you were talking about, but no one noticed.

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:58.620
You fakeded it 'til you maded it.

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.020
No, 'faked it 'til you maked'

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.820
I don't think any of these are words.

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.480
Good meeting!

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.520
Who wants leftovers?

